es or mythic rares). There's 1 Theme Booster for each of Magic's 5 colors, and 1 based on the \"party\" mechanic."}]},{"productId":230865,"name":"Zendikar Rising - Collector Booster Display Case","cleanName":"Zendikar Rising Collector Booster Display Case","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/230865_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2648,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/230865/magic-zendikar-rising-zendikar-rising-collector-booster-display-case","modifiedOn":"2025-11-03T21:41:29.57","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"12 PACKS + 2 BOX TOPPERS. Get 12 Zendikar Rising Collector Boosters plus 2 \"Expedition Land\" box toppers—celebrated land cards with alternate art and frames inspired by the sky dungeons of Zendikar.\r\n<br><br>\r\nCARD STYLES NOT FOUND ANYWHERE ELSE. Collector Boosters are the only Zendikar Rising boosters that contain cards with extended art and the possibility of getting Expedition Lands in foil.\r\n<br><br>\r\nFOIL FULL-ART LANDS AND DOUBLE-FACED CARDS. Zendikar Rising brings a special kind of double-faced card to MTG: play the spell on one side or flip it over and play it as a land instead.\r\n<br><br>\r\nEXPLORE ZENDIKAR. On Zendikar, danger is the norm: wild terrain, cunning predators, and \"the Roil\"—violent ripples of change—all make life precarious and full of adventure.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Zendikar Rising - Collector Booster Display Case contains:\r\n<br>• 6 Magic: The Gathering—Zendikar Rising Collector Booster Boxes\r\n<br>• 12 Magic: The Gathering—Zendikar Rising Collector Booster Packs per Box plus 2 Expedition Lands Box Toppers; each Collector Booster Pack contains: 15 Zendikar Rising cards, designed to show off the most beautiful cards of the set\r\n<br>• 1 double-sided foil token"}]},{"productId":236693,"name":"Zendikar Rising - Collector Booster Hanger Pack","cleanName":"Zendikar Rising Collector Booster Hanger Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/236693_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2648,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/236693/magic-zendikar-rising-zendikar-rising-collector-booster-hanger-pack","modifiedOn":"2021-04-13T23:02:36.85","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Collector Boosters are supercharged booster packs, loaded with nothing but the best. Each pack includes 15 of the most desirable cards from <em>Zendikar Rising</em>.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>Contents:</strong> \r\n<br>• 16 <em>Zendikar Rising</em> cards, designed to show off the most beautiful cards of the set\r\n<br>• 1 double-sided foil token"},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"630509917921"}]},{"productId":266779,"name":"Zendikar Rising - Prerelease Pack Case","cleanName":"Zendikar Rising Prerelease Pack Case","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/266779_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2648,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/266779/magic-zendikar-rising-zendikar-rising-prerelease-pack-case","modifiedOn":"2022-03-21T17:14:33.82","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Each case contains 18 prerelease packs.\r\n<br>\r\n<br><strong>CONTENTS:</strong> <em>(per pack)</em>\r\n<br>• 6 Zendikar Rising Draft Boosters\r\n<br>• 1 foil promo-stamped rare or mythic rare from Zendikar Rising\r\n<br>• 1 Spindown life counter\r\n<br>• 1 MTG Arena code card*\r\n<br><em>*Available Only in Certain Regions</em>"}]},{"productId":509633,"name":"Zendikar Rising - Set Booster Case","cleanName":"Zendikar Rising Set Booster Case","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/509633_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2648,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/509633/magic-zendikar-rising-zendikar-rising-set-booster-case","modifiedOn":"2025-11-03T21:29:54.433","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"THE BEST WAY TO OPEN PACKS JUST FOR THE FUN OF OPENING THEM. Zendikar Rising Set Boosters are the go-to if you're looking to rip open a Magic: The Gathering booster pack just to see what's inside.\r\n<br><br>\r\n30 PACKS + 1 BOX TOPPER. Get 30 Zendikar Rising Set Boosters plus 1 \"Expedition Land\" box topper—a celebrated land card with alternate art and a special frame inspired by the sky dungeons of Zendikar.\r\n<br><br>\r\nA FOIL AND A FULL-ART LAND IN EVERY PACK. Zendikar Rising Set Boosters come with 1 full-art land card, plus at least one foil card. (The foil cards can be any rarity.)\r\n<br><br>\r\nART CARDS. Each Set Booster starts with an art card: a beautiful piece of borderless MTG art, some with the artist's signature across the front in shining gold.\r\n<br><br>\r\n\"THE LIST\"— CARDS FROM MAGIC'S HISTORY. 1 in 4 Set Boosters includes a card from \"The List\"—a pool of reprints, ranging from powerful to flat-out wild, presented in their original art and frame.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Zendikar Rising - Set Booster Case contains:\r\n<br>• 6 Magic: The Gathering—Zendikar Rising Set Booster Boxes\r\n<br>• 30 Magic: The Gathering—Zendikar Rising Set Booster Packs per Box; each Set Booster Pack contains: 14 Zendikar Rising cards:\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising art card\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising full-art basic land\r\n<br>• 6 Zendikar Rising thematically connected commons and uncommons\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising \"head-turning\" card\r\n<br>• 2 Zendikar Rising wildcard rarity cards\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising rare or mythic rare\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising guaranteed foil card\r\n<br>• 1 token, ad card, or card from The List*"}]},{"productId":596369,"name":"Zendikar Rising - Sleeved Set Booster Pack","cleanName":"Zendikar Rising Sleeved Set Booster Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/596369_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":2648,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/596369/magic-zendikar-rising-zendikar-rising-sleeved-set-booster-pack","modifiedOn":"2024-11-19T13:50:11.48","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Set boosters are the go-to for players who love to open boosters just for the fun of seeing what they'll get. Just like Collector Boosters are for collecting and Draft Boosters are for drafting, Set Boosters are for opening packs to see what's inside.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>At least one foil in every pack.</strong> These can be any rarity, so this is one of several places where players can get a rare or mythic rare in a single Set Booster.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>Chance of multiple rares.</strong> Between wildcard slots, the rare slot, and the foil slot, there a several ways to get more than one rare in a Set Booster.\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>Chance at The List*.</strong> 25% of the time, instead of an ad or token card, Set Boosters contain a card from The List* — interesting cards from anywhere in Magic’s history, printed as they appeared <em>(including art, frame, and expansion symbol)</em> plus a small Planeswalker symbol in their lower-left corner.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Each Set Booster Pack contains 14 cards:\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising art card\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising full-art basic land\r\n<br>• 6 Zendikar Rising thematically connected commons and uncommons\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising \"head-turning\" card\r\n<br>• 2 Zendikar Rising wildcard rarity cards\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising rare or mythic rare\r\n<br>• 1 Zendikar Rising guaranteed foil card\r\n<br>• 1 token, ad card, or card from The List*"}]}]}